  "instructions": [
    "1. Drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
    "2. Cut the yellow tomatoes, red onion, and red bell pepper into bite-sized pieces.",
    "3. In a large bowl, combine the chickpeas, tomatoes, onion, and bell pepper.",
    "4. Add the sliced olives and stir to combine.",
    "5. In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "6. Pour the dressing over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "7. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "8. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "9. Serve chilled."
